                                "sense_id": "e1120f89-5294-3fa6-bbbf-2971bc59e69b",
                                "text": "I haue beene wooed, as I intreat thee now, / Euen by the ſterne, and direfull God of warre, / VVhoſe ſinowie necke in battel nere did bow, / VVho conquers where he comes in euery iarre; […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "15a2fad7-5326-486d-801b-c33f1d02c397",
                                "sense_id": "e1120f89-5294-3fa6-bbbf-2971bc59e69b",
                                "text": "read what destiny / Or other dyrefull hap from heaven or hell / Hath wrought this wicked deed […]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "230a0f38-23ad-4685-bdd4-bd29d220769b",
                                "sense_id": "e1120f89-5294-3fa6-bbbf-2971bc59e69b",
                                "text": "\"As whence the sun gins his reflection, shipwrecking storms and direful thunders break.\""
                            }
                        ]
